                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "Tha'd better pin thi slops first or else they'll happen catch t' masheen an' throw thi off."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bbddf55-b111-4215-a5d7-1cd708455af8",
                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "One day Mr. Magilacutty wanted to build a potato masheen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d6acdc7-0ae5-4027-be33-d76db98ef478",
                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "This is the second purpose of the great masheen that we have directed for so many years without any knowledge of why."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd90deae-1e37-458e-b826-749a5d67b6a3",
                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "… and has brought with him a sewing masheen such as I never saw before in my life although I have heard of them, a big masheen glittering with knobs ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e250df62-4074-4edd-8631-1d3539c09174",
                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "The \"Masheen\": The Wool Carding Machine Comes to New England"
                            },
