                                "sense_id": "e9b7e877-69c5-3be6-ac10-f1da2355d72a",
                                "text": "A new Chehalis business is offering old-school entertainment. Time Masheen Arcade, which opened at 570 N. Market Blvd. on Saturday, has more than 20 classic arcade games, including such hits as Frogger, Pac-Man and Dig Dug."
